# Force LF for all text files regardless of a checkout machine's core.autocrlf
# setting. Without this, Git for Windows' default (core.autocrlf=true)
# CRLF-converts the entire working tree on clone, and biome (LF-only) then
# flags nearly every file in the repo as a formatting error.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Provider steering aliases are workspace metadata, not portable runtime files.
# The installer rejects symlinks by design, so exclude this tracked alias from
# release archives rather than weakening extraction safety.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore

# Re-measure this exact-to-actual ceiling after both sides of a merge are in the
# tree. Clones without the locally registered driver get an ordinary conflict;
# resolve that by running `npm run build:ui` and writing the measured JS/CSS
# gzip byte counts into scripts/ui-bundle-budget.json.
scripts/ui-bundle-budget.json merge=station-ui-bundle-budget
